    <Title>About the brushstroke that got away</Title>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"PPL_by_name_of_coded_person","fieldKey":"date"} -->
    <Date>2024-07-01</Date>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"PPL_by_name_of_coded_person","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>The artist talks about an exhibition in total darkness. There is a long passage about a single brush, which the artist calls "the elder".</Description>
